e coding&#x27;s operating point applied to production stakes" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="153.0" y="92.8" width="384.8" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="Ch 21&#x27;s Prompt-and-Pray" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="153.0" y="107.8" width="157.4" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="ADLC" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#047857;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="539.0" y="70.0" width="40.2" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="authority matched to specification and harness" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="539.0" y="92.8" width="306.8" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="HIGH AUTHORITY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#4338CA;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="65.5" width="116.5" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="A2 – A4" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.8;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="85.2" width="51.8" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="VIBE CODING — correct HERE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="153.0" y="161.0" width="217.6" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="prototypes · exploration · learning · personal tools" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="153.0" y="183.8" width="345.8" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="SPEC-DRIVEN" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F766E;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="539.0" y="161.0" width="96.7" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="correct here — and over-ceremony if the authority never" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="539.0" y="183.8" width="365.3" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="rises" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="539.0" y="199.8" width="40.5" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="LOW AUTHORITY" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#4338CA;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="156.5" width="108.8" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="A0 – A1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.8;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="176.2" width="51.8" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="Vibe coding is not wrong. It is a LOCATION. Mode confusion is a location the artefact moved into without anyone deciding." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="243.5" width="815.1" height="17.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Figure 22.4" id="figure-22-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="940" pageHeight="378" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#EEF2FF;strokeColor=#4338CA;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130.0" y="8.0" width="640.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130.0" y="100.0" width="640.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130.0" y="171.0" width="640.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="130.0" y="242.0" width="640.0" height="43.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.8" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="450.0" y="75.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="450.0" y="97.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.8" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="450.0" y="146.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="450.0" y="168.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="endArrow=block;endFill=1;html=1;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.8" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="450.0" y="217.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="450.0" y="239.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="BLAST RADIUS × PERSISTENCE × MAINTAINER COUNT" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#4338CA;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="143.0" y="22.0" width="370.7" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="what breaks if this is wrong? · how long will it exist? · how many people must understand it?" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="143.0" y="44.8" width="612.1" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="all three LOW → vibe coding is correct" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#047857;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="143.0" y="114.0" width="314.3" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="any one HIGH → the acceptance criterion must leave your head" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="143.0" y="185.0" width="491.6" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="two or more HIGH → and the environment must be constrained too (Part II)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="143.0" y="256.0" width="588.3" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="None of the three inputs is a judgement about how good the code looks — deliberately, because that faculty is the one Chapter 18 showed is" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.8;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-26.2" y="293.2" width="952.5" height="17.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="decoupled." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.8;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="411.8" y="310.2" width="76.4" height="17.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Figure 23.1" id="figure-23-1"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="940" pageHeight="257" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#F0FDFA;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="30.0" width="439.0" height="125.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="461.0" y="30.0" width="439.0" height="125.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="175.0" width="900.0" height="38.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="THE CROSSING HAPPENS TO THE CONTEXT, NOT THE CODE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="1.5" width="306.4" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="WHAT WE WATCH — the artefact" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0F766E;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="44.0" width="233.7" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="git · code review · CI" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="66.8" width="150.9" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="static analysis · tests" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="81.8" width="157.4" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="the whole of Part II" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="96.8" width="137.9" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="every instrument in this book points HERE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="112.8" width="274.3" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="WHERE THE CROSSING HAPPENS — its context" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="44.0" width="330.4" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="someone started depending on it" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="66.8" width="209.4" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="someone else edited it" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="81.8" width="150.9" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="it was given a credential" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="96.8" width="170.4" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="it was given a schedule" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="112.8" width="157.4" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="▲ no commit. no diff. nothing to review." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="474.0" y="127.8" width="267.8" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="Version control is blind to the crossing by construction. It is a change-detection system, and no change occurred." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-13.4" y="186.0" width="926.8" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Figure 23.2" id="figure-23-2"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="940" pageHeight="448" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="56.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="56.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="132.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="132.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="208.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="208.0" width="444.0" height="64.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="285.0" width="444.0" height="79.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="456.0" y="285.0" width="444.0" height="79.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="FOUR SIGNALS, EACH DERIVED FROM A FAILURE CONDITION RATHER THAN ASSEMBLED FROM EXPERIENCE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="1.5" width="550.0" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="CH 22 FAILURE CONDITION" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#0F172A;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="128.9" y="31.5" width="186.2" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="THE SIGNAL THAT IT HAS OCCURRED" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#0F172A;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="553.9" y="31.5" width="248.2" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="someone else&#x27;s judgment is now the one that matters" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="70.0" width="419.1" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="① A USER" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="70.0" width="72.5" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="someone depends on it who did not build it" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="92.8" width="280.8" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="intent must be TRANSMITTED rather than remembered" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="146.0" width="402.9" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="② A MAINTAINER" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="146.0" width="120.8" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="a second person edits it" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="168.8" width="163.9" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="failures become SILENT and adversarial" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="222.0" width="314.3" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="③ A SECRET" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="222.0" width="88.6" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="a credential, token or key — the artefact is now worth attacking" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="244.8" width="423.7" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="live judgment is not applied AT ALL" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="13.0" y="299.0" width="290.1" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="④ A SCHEDULE" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=13;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="299.0" width="104.7" height="19.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="it runs unattended — silently promoted to A4 without anyone assessing" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="321.8" width="456.2" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="whether it qualifies" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="469.0" y="336.8" width="137.9" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="The fourth is new to the agentic era, and it is the most common unexamined promotion in engineering organisations." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="380.5" width="768.4" height="17.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Figure 23.3" id="figure-23-3"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="940" pageHeight="384" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=24;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.5;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="272.0" width="774.0" height="68.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#047857;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;html=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="119.5" y="205.5" width="15.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#B45309;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;html=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="413.5" y="158.5" width="15.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#B45309;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;html=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="630.5" y="104.5" width="15.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="ellipse;fillColor=#BE123C;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;html=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="816.5" y="42.5" width="15.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="96.0" y="34.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="96.0" y="224.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="96.0" y="224.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="870.0" y="224.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#F1F5F9;strokeWidth=1" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="96.0" y="52.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="870.0" y="52.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#F1F5F9;strokeWidth=1" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="96.0" y="143.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="870.0" y="143.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#F1F5F9;strokeWidth=1" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="96.0" y="215.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="870.0" y="215.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.6;opacity=30" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="127.0" y="213.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="421.0" y="166.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.6;opacity=30" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="421.0" y="166.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="638.0" y="112.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="" style="endArrow=none;html=1;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=2.6;opacity=30" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="638.0" y="112.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="824.0" y="50.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c14" value="high" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.8;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="52.9" y="45.2" width="33.1" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c15" value="low" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.8;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="59.2" y="208.2" width="26.8" height="16.8" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c16" value="cheap" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#047857;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="101.3" y="181.0" width="51.4" height="20.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c17" value="one dependent, small artefact, structure fresh" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.4;fontColor=#334155;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="-29.1" y="219.6" width="312.2" height="17.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value="dependents accrue" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.4;fontColor=#334155;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="360.8" y="172.6" width="120.4" height="17.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value="structure drifts" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.4;fontColor=#334155;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="581.1" y="118.6" width="113.8" height="17.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value="expensive" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=14;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="780.9" y="18.0" width="86.1" height="20.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value="intent evaporates" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.4;fontColor=#334155;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="763.8" y="56.6" width="120.4" height="17.4" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c22" value="the crossing" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="96.0" y="242.8" width="86.0" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c23" value="TIME SINCE CROSSING ──────►" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="392.9" y="243.0" width="180.3" height="17.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c24" value="a year later" style="text;html=1;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.2;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="784.0" y="242.8" width="86.0" height="17.2" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c25" value="The option to respond cheaply DECAYS — which argues for cheap continuous detection over expensive" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112.0" y="279.5" width="759.8" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c26" value="periodic audit." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#BE123C;resizable=1;fontStyle=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112.0" y="296.5" width="124.2" height="18.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c27" value="By the time an annual shadow-systems review runs, the cheap window has closed on everything it finds." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#64748B;resizable=1" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="112.0" y="314.5" width="681.7" height="17.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="Figure 23.4" id="figure-23-4"><mxGraphModel dx="1100" dy="700" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="940" pageHeight="433" background="#FFFFFF" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="c1" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="56.0" width="292.0" height="77.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304.0" y="56.0" width="292.0" height="77.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="608.0" y="56.0" width="292.0" height="77.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="145.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304.0" y="145.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="608.0" y="145.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c7" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="217.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c8" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304.0" y="217.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c9" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="608.0" y="217.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c10" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#BE123C;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="289.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c11" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#047857;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304.0" y="289.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c12" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=27;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#E2E8F0;strokeWidth=1.4;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="608.0" y="289.0" width="292.0" height="60.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c13" value="INVISIBLE TO PEOPLE · TRIVIAL TO A SCANNER" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10.5;fontColor=#94A3B8;resizable=1;fontFamily=Courier New" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="1.5" width="263.8" height="16.5" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id=